      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Armpit_081ad83",
      "source": "Fanatic: Мы выделяем жизненно необходимую влагу, чтобы жизнь текла дальше!",
      "target": "Fanatic: Éltető nedvességet választunk ki, hogy az élet tovább áramolhasson!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-461.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15880,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451914145794",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Armpit_0418a51",
      "source": "Fanatic: Вот и результат солнечной работы.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Ez a napmunka eredménye.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-461.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15881,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451914145793",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Armpit_0ed4c42",
      "source": "Fanatic: ...",
      "target": "Fanatic: ...",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-040.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15882,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451914145792",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Armpit_00e4b9b",
      "source": "Fanatic: Ну а что, ну понюхай, раз хочется.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Hát jó, szagold meg, ha annyira akarod.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-461.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15883,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451909951497",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Armpit_0a9cc74",
      "source": "Fanatic: Вот ты каков, любитель шалостей!",
      "target": "Fanatic: Szóval ilyen huncut vagy te!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-461.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15884,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451909951496",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Armpit_0081c4b",
      "source": "Fanatic: Вот и результат ухода за собой.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Ez meg az öngondoskodás eredménye.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-461.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15885,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451909951495",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
