      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451897368582",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Teeth_Gun_0408371",
      "source": "Fanatic: А ты попробуй стрельнуть! Правда защитит меня!",
      "target": "Fanatic: Próbálj csak lőni! Az igazság megvéd!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15920,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451897368581",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Photo_09cf62e",
      "source": "Fanatic: ЭТО ЖЕ НА СПАСЕНИЕ ЭНЕРГИИ СОЛНЦА!",
      "target": "Fanatic: EZ A NAP ENERGIÁJÁNAK MEGMENTÉSÉRE SZOLGÁL!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15921,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451897368580",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Photo_0d39be8",
      "source": "Fanatic: А ты мне за это дашь немного денег.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Te pedig adsz majd érte nekem egy kis pénzt.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15922,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451897368579",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Photo_0fa5243",
      "source": "Fanatic: Приходи ко мне, буду рассказывать свое житие-бытие.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Gyere el hozzám, és mesélek neked az életemről.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15923,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451897368578",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Photo_0defdcf",
      "source": "Fanatic: КАК ЖЕ ПРЕКРАСНО ВСЕ ПОЛУЧИЛОСЬ!",
      "target": "Fanatic: MILYEN CSODÁLATOSAN SIKERÜLT MINDEN!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15924,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451897368577",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Photo_0a8eb62",
      "source": "Fanatic: (Вы не замечаете искажений)",
      "target": "Fanatic: (Ön nem vesz észre semmilyen torzulást)",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15925,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451897368576",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Photo_0ad8c68",
      "source": "Fanatic: (Как и в жизни, на фотографии он неухоженный и грязный)",
      "target": "Fanatic: (A fényképen is éppolyan ápolatlan és piszkos, mint élőben)",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15926,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451893174280",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Photo_0239462",
      "source": "Fanatic: (Вы фотографируете неаккуратного мужчину)",
      "target": "Fanatic: (Ön lefényképez egy ápolatlan férfit)",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15927,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451893174279",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Photo_07c2f1a",
      "source": "Fanatic: Давай, ФОТКАЙ МЕНЯ!",
      "target": "Fanatic: Na, FÉNYKÉPEZZ LE!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15928,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451893174278",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Photo_09f716f",
      "source": "Fanatic: Да, я учил его смотреть на солнце, но это я как-нибудь потом расскажу.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Igen, megtanítottam neki, hogy nézzen a Napba, de erről majd máskor mesélek.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15929,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451893174277",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Photo_0a4e55d",
      "source": "Fanatic: Тебе кто-то рассказал, что я здоровался с самим СОЛНЕЧНЫМ ЛИДЕРОМ?",
      "target": "Fanatic: Valaki elmondta neked, hogy magát a NAPVEZÉRT is üdvözöltem?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15930,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451893174276",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Photo_051f086",
      "source": "Fanatic: Хм-хм-хм-хм.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Hm-hm-hm-hm.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15931,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451893174275",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Photo_084dfa3",
      "source": "Fanatic: Сфоткаться?",
      "target": "Fanatic: Fényképezkedni?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15932,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451893174274",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Eyes_0f66391",
      "source": "Достать ружьё",
      "target": "Puska elővétele",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15933,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451893174273",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Eyes_0d19cc0",
      "source": "Отпустить",
      "target": "Elengedés",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15934,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451893174272",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Eyes_064617f",
      "source": "Fanatic: Если нет, ты просто слепец. Попробуй подольше посмотреть на солнце, КАК Я.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Ha nem, akkor egyszerűen vak vagy. Próbálj tovább a Napba nézni, MINT ÉN.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15935,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451888979977",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Eyes_0cf8bb4",
      "source": "Fanatic: ТЫ УВИДЕЛ В МОИХ ГЛАЗАХ ПРАВЕДНУЮ СИЛУ СОЛНЦА?",
      "target": "Fanatic: LÁTTAD A SZEMEMBEN A NAP IGAZSÁGOS EREJÉT?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15936,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451888979976",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Eyes_043cef9",
      "source": "Fanatic: ...",
      "target": "Fanatic: ...",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-040.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15937,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451888979975",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Eyes_0c5e0dd",
      "source": "Fanatic: Все мои силы я получаю из ГЛАЗ!",
      "target": "Fanatic: Minden erőmet a SZEMEMBŐL nyerem!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15938,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451888979974",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Eyes_02731da",
      "source": "Fanatic: Я впитываю ими все блага света, прррреобразуя их в энергию.",
      "target": "Fanatic: A szememmel magamba szívom a fény minden áldását, és ener-r-r-giává alakítom.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15939,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451888979973",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Eyes_053fac8",
      "source": "Fanatic: ЗАГЛЯНИ В МОИ ТЁМНЫЕ ГЛАЗА!",
      "target": "Fanatic: NÉZZ MÉLYEN A SÖTÉT SZEMEMBE!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15940,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451888979972",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Eyes_00f6e16",
      "source": "Fanatic: Они полны ярости и злости.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Tele van haraggal és dühvel.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15941,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451888979971",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Eyes_0f4b459",
      "source": "Fanatic: ЗАГЛЯНИ В МОИ ГЛАЗА!",
      "target": "Fanatic: NÉZZ A SZEMEMBE!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15942,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451888979970",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Hands_09b1d0d",
      "source": "Достать ружьё",
      "target": "Puska elővétele",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15943,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451888979969",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Hands_0a43e5c",
      "source": "Отпустить",
      "target": "Elengedés",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15944,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451888979968",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Hands_0ace904",
      "source": "Fanatic: Ты, это, просто проверить хотел?",
      "target": "Fanatic: Te... csak ellenőrizni akartad?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15945,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451884785674",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Hands_03ed1e1",
      "source": "Fanatic: ...",
      "target": "Fanatic: ...",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-040.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15946,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451884785673",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Hands_0c358bd",
      "source": "Fanatic: И открываю крышки пива.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Meg söröskupakokat nyitok velük.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15947,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451884785672",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Hands_0a657e0",
      "source": "Fanatic: Я натренировался получать ими полезный солнечный свет.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Megtanultam velük befogadni a hasznos napfényt.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15948,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451884785671",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Hands_0e0c5c4",
      "source": "Fanatic: Смотри мои ногти, сколько тебе влезет.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Nézheted a körmeimet, ameddig csak jólesik.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15949,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451884785670",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Hands_09c822b",
      "source": "Fanatic: Никаких запретов, мой друг!",
      "target": "Fanatic: Semmi tiltás, barátom!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-462.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15950,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451884785669",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Death_0bc2431",
      "source": "Fanatic: Приляг-ка ты отдохни, друг.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Dőlj le pihenni egy kicsit, barátom.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-463.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15951,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451884785668",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Death_01d1004",
      "source": "Fanatic: Ты чего, в тени пересидел?",
      "target": "Fanatic: Mi van veled, túl sokáig ültél az árnyékban?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-463.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15952,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451884785667",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Teeth_DontShoot_0b5a44b",
      "source": "Fanatic: Живем дальше.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Élünk tovább.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-463.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15953,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451884785666",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Teeth_DontShoot_05ba4c3",
      "source": "Fanatic: Сейчас столько всего происходит, но мы живем.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Most annyi minden történik, de még élünk.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-463.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15954,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451884785665",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Teeth_DontShoot_06dfc07",
      "source": "Fanatic: Понимаемо, конечно.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Persze, érthető.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-463.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15955,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451884785664",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Teeth_0400db9",
      "source": "Достать ружьё",
      "target": "Puska elővétele",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15956,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451880591370",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Teeth_0554d20",
      "source": "Отпустить",
      "target": "Elengedés",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15957,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451880591369",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Teeth_0f57fe9",
      "source": "Fanatic: А без этого давно бы зубы растерял.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Enélkül már rég kihullottak volna a fogaim.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-463.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15958,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451880591368",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Teeth_0320ade",
      "source": "Fanatic: Я спасаю зубы пивным раствором, он хорошо охраняет кальций.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Sörös oldattal mentem meg a fogaimat, az jól védi a kalciumot.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-463.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15959,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451880591367",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Teeth_0ea7c7c",
      "source": "Fanatic: ...",
      "target": "Fanatic: ...",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-040.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15960,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451880591366",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Teeth_06956fa",
      "source": "Fanatic: Да ты сам посмотри, что я тут в самом деле.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Nézd meg magad, milyen is vagyok én valójában.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-463.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15961,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451880591365",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Teeth_05d059f",
      "source": "Fanatic: Все правды свои я отстоял.",
      "target": "Fanatic: Minden igazságom mellett kiálltam.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-463.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15962,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451880591364",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Teeth_091b8b6",
      "source": "Fanatic: А Я ИМИ ПРАВДЫ ОТСТАИВАЛ!",
      "target": "Fanatic: ÉS ÉN VELÜK VÉDTEM MEG AZ IGAZSÁGAIMAT!",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-463.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15963,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451880591363",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Fanatic_Teeth_08dda0a",
      "source": "Fanatic: Мои зубы тебе показать?",
      "target": "Fanatic: Mutassam meg neked a fogaimat?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-463.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15964,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451880591362",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
